WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.160
Speaker 1: All right, I've got a message for
everybody today, listen very carefully here.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.049
I don't want to be misunderstood.

00:00:06.049 --> 00:00:10.860
I don't care if you want to wear a mask forever.

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.190
And what I mean by that is I don't mind.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:14.190
It doesn't bother me.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:15.190
It's no skin off my back.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.789
It really doesn't bother me at all.

00:00:16.789 --> 00:00:20.849
I'm not going to think twice if you want to
wear a mask forever or for years or indoors

00:00:20.849 --> 00:00:28.220
or outdoors or whatever, I have no interest
whatsoever in telling anybody not to wear

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:34.320
a mask or worrying about people who plan to
wear masks even beyond when the CDC recommends

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.320
it.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:41.519
But there are increasingly more and more Republicans
who are going off the wall with rage and fury

00:00:41.519 --> 00:00:44.650
that other people want to keep wearing masks.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:50.079
Now, this is actually a really big topic because
fundamentally this relates to the psychology

00:00:50.079 --> 00:00:57.589
of the pandemic, pandemic induced PTSD, agoraphobia,
fear adjustment, and a whole bunch of different

00:00:57.589 --> 00:01:00.539
things that I'm glad to talk about in a moment.

00:01:00.539 --> 00:01:06.280
But fundamentally, this reaction from the
right is the absurd hypocrisy of people who

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:11.030
constantly claim for decades they've been
claiming we're about liberty, individual freedoms,

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:14.890
letting people do whatever they want, as long
as it doesn't infringe on someone else's freedom

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:16.280
to do what they want.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:20.840
They are all about letting others do whatever
the hell they want to do.

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:26.840
And they will not stop talking about others
who want to keep wearing masks of no consequence

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:33.420
whatsoever to Tucker Carlson or to whoever
doesn't want to wear a mask, let's look at

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.420
some examples.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:40.649
Here is a recent headline from a Fox News
Tucker Carlson interview with Brit Hume called,

00:01:40.649 --> 00:01:44.340
quote, Some people want to wear their masks
forever.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:51.439
It was a segment dedicated to ridiculing and
criticizing people who may be vaccinated but

00:01:51.439 --> 00:01:53.770
want to continue wearing a mask.

00:01:53.770 --> 00:02:01.649
Here is a segment from Fox News where reporter
Peter Doocy either feigns confusion or is

00:02:01.649 --> 00:02:07.030
really confused about why Joe Biden wore a
mask inside a Ford auto plant earlier this

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:13.050
week despite being vaccinated and despite
the CDC guidelines now saying, you know, vaccinated

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:16.980
people really don't have to wear masks in
most situations, including indoors.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:17.980
Let's take a look at this segment.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:22.090
Speaker 3: But the president is saying a lot
by showing us what he's wearing.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:27.990
We have some new video you can see at a electric
vehicle plant in Dearborn, Michigan.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:32.670
He has got a face mask covering his mouth
and nose, which conflicts with the CDC guidelines

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:37.690
that you don't have to do that or socially
distance indoors or outdoors as long as you

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:42.300
are vaccinated, which the president has been
since before taking the oath of office.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:47.250
Speaker 1: Now, when it comes to that specific
event with Joe Biden at the Ford plant, and

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:53.700
I believe it was Michigan, remember that the
CDC guidelines are not state policy and the

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:58.540
CDC guidelines have not yet been made state
policy in many places and state policy and

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:02.200
state law supersede recommendations from the
CDC.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.030
At the end of the day, they're just recommendations.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:10.170
And, of course, Ford, not just Michigan, Ford
may well still have a policy that everybody's

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:13.360
masking indoors, regardless of vaccination
status.

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.960
Many retailers still do, et cetera.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:20.920
But fundamentally, putting that aside, who
cares if other people want to wear masks?

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:26.600
As I've said before, I don't believe the outdoor
masks were ever really necessary in almost

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.870
any situation.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:32.840
But I did it in order to be a team player
because those were the CDC guidelines and

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.330
or state guidelines.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:39.010
And as soon as the CDC said masks are no longer
recommended outdoors for vaccinated people,

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:43.620
I haven't worn my mask outdoor since other
than in specific situations like waiting in

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:47.200
line to get into a grocery store where the
grocery store recommends it.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:53.050
Now that the CDC has said basically every
activity for vaccinated people is low risk,

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:55.040
I'm seeing other vaccinated people.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:59.950
And the truth is, everybody I know is vaccinated
at this point, but I'm seeing vaccinated.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.830
People indoors were not wearing masks.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:04.180
I've even sat inside of some cafes.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:07.270
But when I see people outside wearing a mask,
I don't care.

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:09.520
I don't give it two seconds of thought.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:14.760
If I if I devote some thought to it, I might
wonder, well, maybe they're not yet vaccinated.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:16.720
OK, so they're wearing a mask.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:22.620
Maybe they have a particular situation medically
where they are at risk, or maybe they just

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:23.770
like covering their face.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:27.560
Or maybe they're afraid because it's been
14 months of this and it takes time for people

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:29.539
to readjust or whatever.

00:04:29.539 --> 00:04:34.669
Who cares just because it's not the CDC recommendation
and just because I'm not doing it?

00:04:34.669 --> 00:04:37.219
What do I care if other people are doing it?

00:04:37.219 --> 00:04:42.430
As long as they are not berating me to do
something that is not part of the CDC recommendation?

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:48.669
So this is yet another one of those instances
in which the hypocritical right wingers claim

00:04:48.669 --> 00:04:53.780
to have certain values, but they don't stand
by them when the rubber meets the road.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:05:01.110
Now, the other reality we also should mention
is that any guidelines where there is a degree

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:07.199
of nuance, where you need more than one sentence,
it's probably too complicated for the people

00:05:07.199 --> 00:05:08.389
that watch Fox News.

00:05:08.389 --> 00:05:13.150
So it wouldn't be surprising to me if the
reason imagine that we looked and like maybe

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:17.319
Michigan has pulled the mask mandate and maybe
Ford did, too.

00:05:17.319 --> 00:05:18.319
I don't know.

00:05:18.319 --> 00:05:19.389
It looks like everybody was wearing a mask
there.

00:05:19.389 --> 00:05:20.759
So Ford probably requires it.

00:05:20.759 --> 00:05:23.849
But imagine that Ford said you don't have
to wear masks if your resident vaccinated.

00:05:23.849 --> 00:05:26.639
Michigan said the same thing.

00:05:26.639 --> 00:05:33.160
If Fox News viewers turn on the TV and absent
any context, they just see Joe Biden walking

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:38.840
around with no mask, many of them are going
to immediately take their masks off in all

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:43.340
situations, even around vaccinated people,
because they don't understand what the hell

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.340
is going on.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:48.969
So in some sense, you could make the case
it makes a lot of sense for the president

00:05:48.969 --> 00:05:55.620
of the US to keep wearing the mask when he's
going to appear on TV and in public so that

00:05:55.620 --> 00:06:00.719
unvaccinated Fox viewers don't see it and
assume they're clear to just do whatever the

00:06:00.719 --> 00:06:05.169
hell they want despite not being vaccinated
and despite being indoors around other unvaccinated

00:06:05.169 --> 00:06:06.169
people.

00:06:06.169 --> 00:06:09.639
So, first of all, I don't care what other
people are doing with their masks, power to

00:06:09.639 --> 00:06:11.430
them to do whatever they want.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:15.590
But at the same time, because we have so many
ignorant people in the United States, in a

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:20.860
way, it kind of makes sense that this is exactly
what Joe Biden would be doing.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:25.870
So come on, guys, just live your life, get
yourself vaccinated, follow the CDC guidelines.

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.069
Don't worry about what other people are doing.

00:06:27.069 --> 00:07:28.120
Let them do whatever they want.

